      "thriller_role": "eureka_pivot",
      "act": 3
    },
    {
      "beat_id": 4,
      "text": "It leverages Tensor Memory Accelerator units to pre-fetch blocks while FP8 matrix multiplications execute in parallel, eliminating downtime.",
